DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18891::$$$message_0146_0000_0000$$$::I head to the castle parlor.[lr]::
18892::$$$message_0146_0000_0001$$$::The ceiling here is high and wide. Tohsaka and Sakura's mansions are impressive, no doubt, but this is on a different level.::
18893::$$$message_0146_0001_0000$$$::"...Wow."[lr]::
18894::$$$message_0146_0001_0001$$$::I push open the heavy door and can't help but ooh and ahh.[lr]::
18895::$$$message_0146_0001_0002$$$::What luxury. I feel like everything in here is built bigger, from the hallways to the rooms.::
18896::$$$message_0146_0002_0000$$$::I'd be able to throw an extravagant dinner party here.[lr]::
18897::$$$message_0146_0002_0001$$$::Of course, it's only used as a branch castle for the Holy Grail War, and mages wouldn't enjoy socializing. What a waste.::
18898::$$$message_0146_0003_0000$$$::"...Oh, yeah."[lr]::
18899::$$$message_0146_0003_0001$$$::I see the brilliant, sparkling chandelier and remember something.[lr]::
18900::$$$message_0146_0003_0002$$$::Sakura was saying that she wanted to eat somewhere fancy.[lr]::
18901::$$$message_0146_0003_0003$$$::This castle would be exactly what she wished for.::
18902::$$$message_0146_0004_0000$$$::"...In that case..."[lr]::
18903::$$$message_0146_0004_0001$$$::It would be best to consult the owner here.::
18904::$$$message_0146_0005_0000$$$::"...Wait, how am I supposed to consult her, do I ask her to let me borrow her dining hall?"[lr]::
18905::$$$message_0146_0005_0001$$$::My objective is to have dinner with Sakura.[lr]::
18906::$$$message_0146_0005_0002$$$::Even if Illya is nice to Sakura, would she readily agree...?::
18907::$$$message_0146_0006_0000$$$::"Illya, are you there?"[lr]::
18908::$$$message_0146_0006_0001$$$::"Shirou? Yeah, come in."::
18909::$$$message_0146_0007_0000$$$::I go in her room, worrying about how I should bring it up.[lr]::
18910::$$$message_0146_0007_0001$$$::"What's wrong, Shirou? Did you get lost and forget where the bathroom is?"[lr]::
18911::$$$message_0146_0007_0002$$$::"I do remember... No, that's not why I'm here."::
18912::$$$message_0146_0008_0000$$$::"Okay, then what is it?"[lr]::
18913::$$$message_0146_0008_0001$$$::"Um, well. I know how rude this might sound, but..."::
18914::$$$message_0146_0009_0000$$$::...It isn't smart to get right to the point.[lr]::
18915::$$$message_0146_0009_0001$$$::But it's also not good to lie to Illya either, so I should ask her straight.::
18916::$$$message_0146_0010_0000$$$::"Okay? I already know that you're not very polite."[lr]::
18917::$$$message_0146_0010_0001$$$::"...I'm glad to hear that. Um, you know how this is a castle?"::
18918::$$$message_0146_0011_0000$$$::"Yes. What about it?"[lr]::
18919::$$$message_0146_0011_0001$$$::"Well, I know it's sudden, but I was hoping to have a private dinner here."::
18920::$$$message_0146_0012_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
18921::$$$message_0146_0012_0001$$$::"With Sakura, though."::
18922::$$$message_0146_0013_0000$$$::Talk about a 180.[lr]::
18923::$$$message_0146_0013_0001$$$::Illya suddenly turns into a rabbit that doesn't want anyone to play with it.::
18924::$$$message_0146_0014_0000$$$::"Hmph... [wm canskip=0]A date with Sakura at the castle? Why?"[lr]::
18925::$$$message_0146_0014_0001$$$::"Date...? I guess it's a date. These things are dates, huh? Well, it's vague when putting it into words, but if you're okay with it."::
18926::$$$message_0146_0015_0000$$$::"I don't mind.[lr]::
18927::$$$message_0146_0015_0001$$$::Sit down, Shirou."[lr]::
18928::$$$message_0146_0015_0002$$$::Intimidated, I sit in the chair.::
18929::$$$message_0146_0016_0000$$$::"It was just a small promise I made her.[lr]::
18930::$$$message_0146_0016_0001$$$::She was saying that she wants to dress up and eat at a fancy place together someday. And thinking about it, there's nowhere fancier than here."[lr]::
18931::$$$message_0146_0016_0002$$$::"Really? This is just a vacation home, so it's plain."[lr]::
18932::$$$message_0146_0016_0003$$$::...Guh.[lr]::
18933::$$$message_0146_0016_0004$$$::If this is plain to her, then I wonder how she'd rate my house.::
18934::$$$message_0146_0017_0000$$$::"No, it's plenty fancy. I think it's the most extravagant castle in all of Japan, not just Fuyuki."[lr]::
18935::$$$message_0146_0017_0001$$$::I press forward without any flattery.[lr]::
18936::$$$message_0146_0017_0002$$$::Praise toward the castle must not mean anything, as Illya seems to be deep in thought.::
18937::$$$message_0146_0018_0000$$$::"I see, Sakura... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ11a(中) time=300 textoff=0]The location is fine, but how are you going to dress up?"[lr]::
18938::$$$message_0146_0018_0001$$$::"Oh. Well, I don't know yet."[lr]::
18939::$$$message_0146_0018_0002$$$::I assumed I could discuss the other details with Sakura once I have secured a location.::
18940::$$$message_0146_0019_0000$$$::"...[chgfg storage=イリヤ01c(中) time=200 textoff=0][say storage=makyo15_iri_0100 name=イリヤ]So, it was on a whim."[lr]::
18941::$$$message_0146_0019_0001$$$::"Yeah. Sorry."[lr]::
18942::$$$message_0146_0019_0002$$$::"Haah, that's so like you, Shirou... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ11c(中) time=200 textoff=0]Sakura's going to dress up, huh?"::
18943::$$$message_0146_0020_0000$$$::Illya contemplates it, hands clasped behind her back.::
18944::$$$message_0146_0021_0000$$$::"Yeah, I'll have to do something about you two."[lr]::
18945::$$$message_0146_0021_0001$$$::"...Meaning?"::
18946::$$$message_0146_0022_0000$$$::"A date with Rin would be out of the question.[lr]::
18947::$$$message_0146_0022_0001$$$::But I'll make an allowance for Sakura.[lr]::
18948::$$$message_0146_0022_0002$$$::Besides..."::
18949::$$$message_0146_0023_0000$$$::"I need to support Sakura, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中) textoff=0]and I need to look after you.[lr]::
18950::$$$message_0146_0023_0001$$$::Right, Big Brother?"::
18951::$$$message_0146_0024_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18952::$$$message_0146_0024_0001$$$::Wahh, I'm such a pathetic big brother.[lr]::
18953::$$$message_0146_0024_0002$$$::But Illya's the only one I can ask.[lr]::
18954::$$$message_0146_0024_0003$$$::I'll humbly accept the label and ask my noble little sister for help.::
18955::$$$message_0146_0025_0000$$$::"So, does that mean it's okay?"[lr]::
18956::$$$message_0146_0025_0001$$$::"Yeah, then let's hold a dinner party tonight.[lr]::
18957::$$$message_0146_0025_0002$$$::I should have some dresses, so I'll lend them to her."[lr]::
18958::$$$message_0146_0025_0003$$$::"Really!?"::
18959::$$$message_0146_0026_0000$$$::The conversation takes a sudden turn and we come to an agreement.[lr]::
18960::$$$message_0146_0026_0001$$$::I see, so there are dresses in this castle. That would also solve the issue of dressing up.::
18961::$$$message_0146_0027_0000$$$::Thank you, Illya...! I'm so happy I want to lift her up and hug her, but...[lr]::
18962::$$$message_0146_0027_0001$$$::...Illya is chuckling strangely.::
18963::$$$message_0146_0028_0000$$$::"...Did I do something weird?"[lr]::
18964::$$$message_0146_0028_0001$$$::"Heheh, oh, you still haven't noticed, Shirou?"[cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(近)][wvs][fg opacity=0 left=610 index=2000 top=155 time=200 storage=イリヤ11a(近) textoff=0][lr]::
18965::$$$message_0146_0028_0002$$$::"Noticed what?"[lr]::
18966::$$$message_0146_0028_0003$$$::Illya circles around me and observes me.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
18967::$$$message_0146_0028_0004$$$::[move time=100 path=(509,185,255)(488,202,255)(471,196,255)(360,165,255)(265,189,255)(253,199,255)(231,155,255) storage=イリヤ11a(近) accel=-2 spline=1 textoff=0]...I get a bad feeling from her laugh.[wm canskip=0]::
18968::$$$message_0146_0029_0000$$$::"Shirou? Do you plan to attend my dinner party like that?"[lr]::
18969::$$$message_0146_0029_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
18970::$$$message_0146_0029_0002$$$::Of course I plan to wear something decent for a meal like that[line len=2]I think to myself and check my own outfit.[lr]::
18971::$$$message_0146_0029_0003$$$::A sweatshirt, jeans, and sneakers...::
18972::$$$message_0146_0030_0000$$$::"Do I have to change, too!?"[lr]::
18973::$$$message_0146_0030_0001$$$::"Don't get surprised now. It's meaningless if Sakura is in a dress and you're like that, right?"::
18974::$$$message_0146_0031_0000$$$::"Well, I'm fine..."[lr]::
18975::$$$message_0146_0031_0001$$$::I don't even own any suits.[lr]::
18976::$$$message_0146_0031_0002$$$::Should I just wear my school uniform? That would at least look better.::
18977::$$$message_0146_0032_0000$$$::"Hey, Shirou. I said yes because, just like how you want to dress Sakura up, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01f(近)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ01f(近) textoff=0]I also want to play dress-up with you."::
18978::$$$message_0146_0033_0000$$$::Illya laughs jovially.[lr]::
18979::$$$message_0146_0033_0001$$$::She's giving off that vibe like she's going to put my consciousness into a strange container and play with it... Did I dig my own grave?::
18980::$$$message_0146_0034_0000$$$::"Shirou, I'm not telling you to wear palace attire to my dinner party, but I need you to at least show a modicum of manners."[lr]::
18981::$$$message_0146_0034_0001$$$::"Right, it's a dinner party at a castle. But I..."::
18982::$$$message_0146_0035_0000$$$::"I'm sure Sakura wants to see you in a suit, too. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01c(近)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01c(近) textoff=0]That settles it. Sella! Leys!"::
18983::$$$message_0146_0036_0000$$$::The maids appear swiftly at the clap of her hands.[lr]::
18984::$$$message_0146_0036_0001$$$::They're so alert it makes me wonder if guarding the garden is all they do.::
18985::$$$message_0146_0037_0000$$$::"What do you require, Mistress?"[lr]::
18986::$$$message_0146_0037_0001$$$::"Prepare Shirou a tuxedo. A black bow tie, a white collared shirt, and leather shoes.[lr]::
18987::$$$message_0146_0037_0002$$$::Once that's done, get a dress ready for Sakura and prepare tonight's dinner."::
18988::$$$message_0146_0038_0000$$$::"Understood, my lady."[lr]::
18989::$$$message_0146_0038_0001$$$::"...Illya, that sounds hard..."[lr]::
18990::$$$message_0146_0038_0002$$$::"Yeah, Shirou might not like it, but make him change, even if you have to use force to do it."::
18991::$$$message_0146_0039_0000$$$::Things are moving quickly in front of my eyes.[lr]::
18992::$$$message_0146_0039_0001$$$::I didn't think I would end up having to wear a tuxedo.[lr]::
18993::$$$message_0146_0039_0002$$$::I should've expected the Einzberns to not only have dresses, but men's suits too... Well, this is hardly the time to be impressed.::
18994::$$$message_0146_0040_0000$$$::"...We need to take Master Emiya's measurements first. Leysritt!"[lr]::
18995::$$$message_0146_0040_0001$$$::"...I know, Sella."::
18996::$$$message_0146_0041_0000$$$::Leys produces a measuring tape. I have no idea where she keeps it in her dress.[lr]::
18997::$$$message_0146_0041_0001$$$::Sella takes it in her hands and takes my measurements as if surveying some unpleasant obstacle.::
18998::$$$message_0146_0042_0000$$$::"...Do I have to, Illya?"[lr]::
18999::$$$message_0146_0042_0001$$$::"Suck it up already. You also want to see Sakura in a dress, right? [cacheimage storage=リズ01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01c(近) textoff=0]It's an equivalent exchange."::
19000::$$$message_0146_0043_0000$$$::Here, she speaks as a mage would.[lr]::
19001::$$$message_0146_0043_0001$$$::...Well, if you put it that way, wearing a tuxedo is a cheap price to pay.::
19002::$$$message_0146_0044_0000$$$::"That's right, I need to let Sakura know."[lr]::
19003::$$$message_0146_0044_0001$$$::"No need to worry, I'll send her an invitation. Pretend you're here because you got one, too."::
19004::$$$message_0146_0045_0000$$$::An invitation... It's getting into full swing.[lr]::
19005::$$$message_0146_0045_0001$$$::Invitations would be sent out beforehand if it were a real dinner party, but I didn't think I'd actually be directly involved in something like that.::
19006::$$$message_0146_0046_0000$$$::"Sorry for the trouble."[lr]::
19007::$$$message_0146_0046_0001$$$::"It's fine, if it's for you and Sakura. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06b(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ06b(遠) textoff=0]Hehehe."[lr]::
19008::$$$message_0146_0046_0002$$$::Illya seems to be very pleased about her own plan.[lr]::
19009::$$$message_0146_0046_0003$$$::Leys and Sella seem to be quickly preparing our clothes, so I can only prepare myself.::
19010::$$$message_0146_0047_0000$$$::"Master Emiya, [cacheimage storage=リズ01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01c(近) textoff=0]we have finished preparing your clothes. Please come this way."[lr]::
19011::$$$message_0146_0047_0001$$$::"Yeah... Illya, you're going to laugh once you see me looking my best."[lr]::
19012::$$$message_0146_0047_0002$$$::"I don't know about that. I'm looking forward to it."::
19013::$$$message_0146_0048_0000$$$::"Ahh..."[lr]::
19014::$$$message_0146_0048_0001$$$::It's tiring to wear something you're not used to wearing.[lr]::
19015::$$$message_0146_0048_0002$$$::I feel like I'm constantly being choked in this shirt and bow tie.::
19016::$$$message_0146_0049_0000$$$::I check myself in a nearby mirror.[lr]::
19017::$$$message_0146_0049_0001$$$::It's bizarre seeing myself wearing a black tuxedo. I've never even worn a suit before, and this is even more formal than that.::
19018::$$$message_0146_0050_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19019::$$$message_0146_0050_0001$$$::On top of that, there's Sakura's dress.[lr]::
19020::$$$message_0146_0050_0002$$$::They didn't even let me take a peek at it.[lr]::
19021::$$$message_0146_0050_0003$$$::Illya stopped me on the way to Sakura's room, telling me to look forward to seeing her.::
19022::$$$message_0146_0051_0000$$$::So, I'm waiting in the lobby until Sakura finishes changing and getting ready...[lr]::
19023::$$$message_0146_0051_0001$$$::It's finally time.::
19024::$$$message_0146_0052_0000$$$::"...Ehehe, you look good, Shirou."[lr]::
19025::$$$message_0146_0052_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Wha... Oh, Illya.[lr]::
19026::$$$message_0146_0052_0002$$$::Are you wearing a dress, Illya?"[lr]::
19027::$$$message_0146_0052_0003$$$::"I haven't quite made my debut yet, so this is semi-formal.[lr]::
19028::$$$message_0146_0052_0004$$$::Well, you don't look that bad yourself."::
19029::$$$message_0146_0053_0000$$$::I don't know how to answer.[lr]::
19030::$$$message_0146_0053_0001$$$::My tuxedo is like a costume, so it's hard for me to judge, no matter what I'm told.::
19031::$$$message_0146_0054_0000$$$::"I don't really know. It's my first time wearing something like this."[lr]::
19032::$$$message_0146_0054_0001$$$::"Really? It wouldn't look right on you normally, but this is an interesting side of you.[lr]::
19033::$$$message_0146_0054_0002$$$::All that's left is...yes, it's about time for the princess to make her appearance."::
19034::$$$message_0146_0055_0000$$$::"Princess"... Is she talking about Sakura?[lr]::
19035::$$$message_0146_0055_0001$$$::I look toward the grand staircase. She was getting ready upstairs, so she must be coming down from there.::
19036::$$$message_0146_0056_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19037::$$$message_0146_0056_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
19038::$$$message_0146_0056_0002$$$::I hold my breath and wait, but she's not coming out.[lr]::
19039::$$$message_0146_0056_0003$$$::Maybe she got lost on the way... I don't think so.[lr]::
19040::$$$message_0146_0056_0004$$$::Illya calls out, as if she got tired of waiting.::
19041::$$$message_0146_0057_0000$$$::"Sakura? What's wrong?"[lr]::
19042::$$$message_0146_0057_0001$$$::"U-um, Senpai is there, right?"[lr]::
19043::$$$message_0146_0057_0002$$$::Only her voice reaches us.[lr]::
19044::$$$message_0146_0057_0003$$$::I'm relieved that she's actually here, but I wonder why she's not showing herself.::
19045::$$$message_0146_0058_0000$$$::"He's here. In a tuxedo."[lr]::
19046::$$$message_0146_0058_0001$$$::"Oh... R-really?[lr]::
19047::$$$message_0146_0058_0002$$$::B-but, I...don't look good in something like this, um, so[line len=2]"[lr]::
19048::$$$message_0146_0058_0003$$$::"Huh... Could it be that you're embarrassed after coming all the way here?"::
19049::$$$message_0146_0059_0000$$$::...Oh, so Sakura's also embarrassed.[lr]::
19050::$$$message_0146_0059_0001$$$::Wearing a dress and being invited to a dinner party out of the blue... I'm sure Sakura is even more troubled than I am.::
19051::$$$message_0146_0060_0000$$$::"Hmm, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01c(中) textoff=0]even though you were full of enthusiasm asking if Senpai would like it until just now?"[lr]::
19052::$$$message_0146_0060_0001$$$::"I-Illya! B-But Senpai is..."::
19053::$$$message_0146_0061_0000$$$::"Well, I'm also in an outfit that doesn't suit me, so it's fine. Besides, you wouldn't look bad in anything."[cacheimage storage=イリヤ05a(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ05a(中) textoff=0][lr]::
19054::$$$message_0146_0061_0001$$$::Also, it can't be any worse than me in a tuxedo.::
19055::$$$message_0146_0062_0000$$$::"...Senpai, um, will you promise not to laugh?"[lr]::
19056::$$$message_0146_0062_0001$$$::"You too, don't laugh when you see me."[lr]::
19057::$$$message_0146_0062_0002$$$::"Ugh, you two sure are irritating... Don't worry, Sakura. It's a special evening dress. I'll make sure to punish him if he laughs."::
19058::$$$message_0146_0063_0000$$$::Illya whispers that the opposite is also true.[lr]::
19059::$$$message_0146_0063_0001$$$::...It can't be helped if I get laughed at, so I quietly ask her to go easy on Sakura.[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11d(近) textoff=0]::
19060::$$$message_0146_0064_0000$$$::"...Yes. Then, Senpai..."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
19061::$$$message_0146_0064_0001$$$::I hear the sound of a rustling dress.[lr]::
19062::$$$message_0146_0064_0002$$$::Sakura appears above the hall.::
19063::$$$message_0146_0065_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19064::$$$message_0146_0065_0001$$$::She looks like a lady from high society, straight out of a movie.[lr]::
19065::$$$message_0146_0065_0002$$$::An open shoulder dress,[lr]::
19066::$$$message_0146_0065_0003$$$::pearls and hair accessories that accentuate her fair skin,[lr]::
19067::$$$message_0146_0065_0004$$$::and lipstick...[lr]::
19068::$$$message_0146_0065_0005$$$::More than anything, seeing Sakura in a dress for the first time is a vibrant sight that I can't forget.::
19069::$$$message_0146_0066_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19070::$$$message_0146_0066_0001$$$::We just stare at each other, unsure of what to say.[lr]::
19071::$$$message_0146_0066_0002$$$::Sakura is still standing up there.::
19072::$$$message_0146_0067_0000$$$::"Come on, Shirou. [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=500 count=-3]Escort Sakura. Are you trying to make a fool out of her?"[lr]::
19073::$$$message_0146_0067_0001$$$::An elbow nudges me in the back.::
19074::$$$message_0146_0068_0000$$$::"Oh[line len=2]yeah, I'll do that."[lr]::
19075::$$$message_0146_0068_0001$$$::Prompted, I move forward.[lr]::
19076::$$$message_0146_0068_0002$$$::I adjust my breathing and go up the stairs.[lr]::
19077::$$$message_0146_0068_0003$$$::I don't know what I should say to Sakura.[wdash canskip=0]::
19078::$$$message_0146_0069_0000$$$::"Yeah, uh... It looks good on you, Sakura."[lr]::
19079::$$$message_0146_0069_0001$$$::"Um, you too, Senpai... It's my first time seeing you dressed up so formally."::
19080::$$$message_0146_0070_0000$$$::"R-really? ...Yeah, it is, huh?[lr]::
19081::$$$message_0146_0070_0001$$$::I don't even own a suit."[lr]::
19082::$$$message_0146_0070_0002$$$::I slightly regret not having cared about that until now.[lr]::
19083::$$$message_0146_0070_0003$$$::Sakura even [font italic=true]smells[font italic=false] different.[lr]::
19084::$$$message_0146_0070_0004$$$::I get a whiff and notice she's wearing a different perfume than usual.::
19085::$$$message_0146_0071_0000$$$::"This doesn't suit me at all. Tohsaka would laugh if she saw this."[lr]::
19086::$$$message_0146_0071_0001$$$::"That's not true. Knowing my sister, she'd probably freeze up instead.[lr]::
19087::$$$message_0146_0071_0002$$$::...Umm. Th-that's how I feel right now, too.[lr]::
19088::$$$message_0146_0071_0003$$$::I'm really happy to see you, Senpai."::
19089::$$$message_0146_0072_0000$$$::Sakura blushes and looks down.[lr]::
19090::$$$message_0146_0072_0001$$$::"Why are you so happy, Sakura?"[lr]::
19091::$$$message_0146_0072_0002$$$::I'm the one who's happy.::
19092::$$$message_0146_0073_0000$$$::"Well... Um, I was thinking you look like a prince on a white horse.[lr]::
19093::$$$message_0146_0073_0001$$$::I've always dreamed of having a man in a tuxedo come to greet me."::
19094::$$$message_0146_0074_0000$$$::Sakura nervously extends her arm.[lr]::
19095::$$$message_0146_0074_0001$$$::Her silk-gloved fingers try to touch my arm.::
19096::$$$message_0146_0075_0000$$$::"Um... May I take your arm, Senpai?"[lr]::
19097::$$$message_0146_0075_0001$$$::"Of course. Wow, we're actually doing this..."[cacheimage storage=fd20][wvs][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=-37 index=2000 top=0 time=200 storage=fd20][lr]::
19098::$$$message_0146_0075_0002$$$::Sakura walks arm-in-arm with me.[lr]::
19099::$$$message_0146_0075_0003$$$::Being with Sakura in a dress in the middle of the hall of the Einzbern Castle is almost like...::
19100::$$$message_0146_0076_0000$$$::"I can't believe we're doing this in Japan."[lr]::
19101::$$$message_0146_0076_0001$$$::"Yes, it's like a fairy tale.[lr]::
19102::$$$message_0146_0076_0002$$$::I thought that it would be lovely to go to a ball in a beautiful castle ever since I was little."[lr]::
19103::$$$message_0146_0076_0003$$$::"A fairy tale, huh? We have a real witch here, too."::
19104::$$$message_0146_0077_0000$$$::"Heh, so Rin is the evil witch who bullies you two, and I'm the good witch who supports you two."[lr]::
19105::$$$message_0146_0077_0001$$$::Illya says proudly.[lr]::
19106::$$$message_0146_0077_0002$$$::Being a step behind Sakura, I escort her down the stairs.[lr]::
19107::$$$message_0146_0077_0003$$$::The hem of her dress slightly brushes the floor.::
19108::$$$message_0146_0078_0000$$$::"Hmm... I was a bit worried, but you two look good together, if I say so myself. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01f(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01f(遠) textoff=0]Pure and innocent."[lr]::
19109::$$$message_0146_0078_0001$$$::"Oh... Thank you, Illya."::
19110::$$$message_0146_0079_0000$$$::"Sorry for having you arrange everything."[lr]::
19111::$$$message_0146_0079_0001$$$::"Yes, yes, you can tell me all that later.[lr]::
19112::$$$message_0146_0079_0002$$$::Dinner is ready, so come this way."::
19113::$$$message_0146_0080_0000$$$::Illya bows gracefully like a mistress and beckons us forward.[lr]::
19114::$$$message_0146_0080_0001$$$::Sakura's been linking arms with me the whole time.[lr]::
19115::$$$message_0146_0080_0002$$$::I'm nervous, but I can feel Sakura's heart beating faster than me through my arm. Now's not the time to get flustered.::
19116::$$$message_0146_0081_0000$$$::The table is set with all the plateware and utensils you can imagine.[lr]::
19117::$$$message_0146_0081_0001$$$::Illya takes the seat of honor in the back, while Sakura and I sit across from each other. This would make quite a sight if we had enough visitors to fill the table.::
19118::$$$message_0146_0082_0000$$$::"...Okay."[lr]::
19119::$$$message_0146_0082_0001$$$::Then, Sella and Leys work diligently to serve us.[lr]::
19120::$$$message_0146_0082_0002$$$::I can't relax, thinking that what is about to start is a formal dinner.::
19121::$$$message_0146_0083_0000$$$::When I look over, Sakura who is in front of me also seems restless.::
19122::$$$message_0146_0084_0000$$$::"...Ahaha. I can't relax at all, Senpai."[lr]::
19123::$$$message_0146_0084_0001$$$::"...Me neither. I should've had someone teach me table etiquette for times like this."::
19124::$$$message_0146_0085_0000$$$::"It's fine. I won't tell you to balance green peas on the back of the fork or peel an orange with a fork and knife."[lr]::
19125::$$$message_0146_0085_0001$$$::Illya chuckles and picks up her glass.[lr]::
19126::$$$message_0146_0085_0002$$$::Leys and Sella pour a cold beverage into our glasses.[se storage=se561.wav]::
19127::$$$message_0146_0086_0000$$$::"Now, thank you for coming to my dinner party today. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ06e(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]Shirou, Sakura.[lr]::
19128::$$$message_0146_0086_0001$$$::You both look great in the clothes I picked for you."[lr]::
19129::$$$message_0146_0086_0002$$$::"I'm honored."::
19130::$$$message_0146_0087_0000$$$::"I can't entertain you two properly today, but please make yourselves feel at home.[lr]::
19131::$$$message_0146_0087_0001$$$::Okay, you're next, Shirou."::
19132::$$$message_0146_0088_0000$$$::Like a card game, it becomes my turn.[lr]::
19133::$$$message_0146_0088_0001$$$::...Huh? Does the guest of honor in places like this have to make some speech before their meal?::
19134::$$$message_0146_0089_0000$$$::"Oh...well..."[lr]::
19135::$$$message_0146_0089_0001$$$::My mind goes blank.[lr]::
19136::$$$message_0146_0089_0002$$$::I pick up the glass first and try swirling the white liquid for no reason.::
19137::$$$message_0146_0090_0000$$$::"Um...thank you for granting my unreasonable request and preparing such a fine venue.[lr]::
19138::$$$message_0146_0090_0001$$$::I want to thank you properly, and are you also, um, enjoying this, Sakura?"[lr]::
19139::$$$message_0146_0090_0002$$$::I can't think of anything more than this.::
19140::$$$message_0146_0091_0000$$$::"Oh... Yes, I am! This dress is beautiful, [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊03j頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=桜fd特殊03j頬(中) textoff=0]Senpai looks handsome, and this castle and dinner are splendid. For me, it's too...[cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊03k(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊03k(中) textoff=0]um..."::
19141::$$$message_0146_0092_0000$$$::"...Mm, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]ah, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]I shouldn't cry, even if it's because I'm happy... [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊03d頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=500 storage=桜fd特殊03d頬(近)]Thank you, Senpai, Illya.[lr]::
19142::$$$message_0146_0092_0001$$$::I'm very happy to be here."[lr]::
19143::$$$message_0146_0092_0002$$$::"Thank you, Sakura. This is all I can do to help, but I'm glad that you're happy.[lr]::
19144::$$$message_0146_0092_0003$$$::Now... Cheers."::
19145::$$$message_0146_0093_0000$$$::Dinner begins.[lr]::
19146::$$$message_0146_0093_0001$$$::Elegant dishes and rich-tasting wine come out one after another.[lr]::
19147::$$$message_0146_0093_0002$$$::Illya looks on in satisfaction, while Leys and Sella respectfully serve us.[lr]::
19148::$$$message_0146_0093_0003$$$::Sakura is smiling shyly.[lr]::
19149::$$$message_0146_0093_0004$$$::She's on the verge of tears, soaking in the simple happiness.::
19150::$$$message_0146_0094_0000$$$::"Ahh... That was delicious. I'm so impressed by the food of Illya's house."[lr]::
19151::$$$message_0146_0094_0001$$$::It's after dinner.[lr]::
19152::$$$message_0146_0094_0002$$$::After having dessert, I ended up escorting Sakura here.::
19153::$$$message_0146_0095_0000$$$::"That surprised me, too. I didn't know Leys and Sella were so good at cooking."[lr]::
19154::$$$message_0146_0095_0001$$$::"Do you think it was Sella? Or was there a chef? I wonder if it's better to learn traditional French cooking here... Hmm."::
19155::$$$message_0146_0096_0000$$$::We can't help but talk about cooking.[lr]::
19156::$$$message_0146_0096_0001$$$::...I feel silly.[lr]::
19157::$$$message_0146_0096_0002$$$::Sakura wearing a dress is in the garden alone with me, so I should say something more thoughtful.::
19158::$$$message_0146_0097_0000$$$::"...Sakura."[lr]::
19159::$$$message_0146_0097_0001$$$::"Senpai, you're the one who granted my wish today, right?"[lr]::
19160::$$$message_0146_0097_0002$$$::Just as I was about to speak, she says that.::
19161::$$$message_0146_0098_0000$$$::"...Well, yeah. I just happened to remember, and Illya helped me out.[lr]::
19162::$$$message_0146_0098_0001$$$::The result exceeded my expectations, though."::
19163::$$$message_0146_0099_0000$$$::"Yes. It was something I said on a whim without thinking, but you actually remembered."::
19164::$$$message_0146_0100_0000$$$::That was on the usual way back home.[lr]::
19165::$$$message_0146_0100_0001$$$::After buying and eating food with Sakura, I held onto that secret and wanted to grant that little wish.::
19166::$$$message_0146_0101_0000$$$::"I was surprised at first.[lr]::
19167::$$$message_0146_0101_0001$$$::Illya and the maids came, and while I was still surprised, they prepared a dress and told me I was invited to the dinner party tonight."::
19168::$$$message_0146_0102_0000$$$::"Ah... That would be surprising. Sorry, I should've told you beforehand."[lr]::
19169::$$$message_0146_0102_0001$$$::"Hehe. I didn't know what was going on at all at first, but once I found out that you were also coming, I thought... Oh, it's that.::
19170::$$$message_0146_0103_0000$$$::It was quite sudden.[lr]::
19171::$$$message_0146_0103_0001$$$::But, had Illya not arranged everything, it most likely wouldn't have turned out this way.::
19172::$$$message_0146_0104_0000$$$::"Well, it was a lot for me too. I didn't think that even I was going to dress up.[lr]::
19173::$$$message_0146_0104_0001$$$::Ugh, this too[line len=2]Well, whatever."[lr]::
19174::$$$message_0146_0104_0002$$$::During the dinner, I thought of taking off the bow tie choking my neck, but I didn't.[lr]::
19175::$$$message_0146_0104_0003$$$::If Sakura is still dressed up, her wish isn't over yet.::
19176::$$$message_0146_0105_0000$$$::"I'm glad I asked Illya. I wouldn't have been able to keep this promise on my own."[lr]::
19177::$$$message_0146_0105_0001$$$::"...Yes. I never dreamed that I'd get to wear a dress like this."::
19178::$$$message_0146_0106_0000$$$::Sakura holds up the hem of her dress and twirls in place.[lr]::
19179::$$$message_0146_0106_0001$$$::She's a cherry blossom dancing in the moonlit garden.::
19180::$$$message_0146_0107_0000$$$::"It really is like a fairy tale.[lr]::
19181::$$$message_0146_0107_0001$$$::I get invited to a dinner party at this castle wearing a dress, you come pick me up, and now we're talking in the garden at night."[lr]::
19182::$$$message_0146_0107_0002$$$::"...Yeah. It's a little too good to be true."::
19183::$$$message_0146_0108_0000$$$::"Hehe. Illya may actually be a wonderful witch who cast a lovely spell on us."::
19184::$$$message_0146_0109_0000$$$::That's a good way to put it.[lr]::
19185::$$$message_0146_0109_0001$$$::But, this kind of fairy tale tends to end by going back to the way things were before.::
19186::$$$message_0146_0110_0000$$$::"If this is magic, then it's going to end, isn't it?"[lr]::
19187::$$$message_0146_0110_0001$$$::"Yeah. I'd expect it to wear off once the clock strikes twelve."[lr]::
19188::$$$message_0146_0110_0002$$$::"Then I would forget my glass slipper on the staircase, and you would pick that up and look for me.[lr]::
19189::$$$message_0146_0110_0003$$$::But even then, I would no longer come back dressed up."::
19190::$$$message_0146_0111_0000$$$::"...Why is that?"[lr]::
19191::$$$message_0146_0111_0001$$$::"Because...it's better if it stays a beautiful memory.[lr]::
19192::$$$message_0146_0111_0002$$$::Besides, instead of being with you dressed up... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊03j(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊03j(中) textoff=0]I want to be by your side, as my normal self, forever."::
19193::$$$message_0146_0112_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19194::$$$message_0146_0112_0001$$$::...That wish, no matter how small, is a certain one.[lr]::
19195::$$$message_0146_0112_0002$$$::She's no fairy-tale princess.[lr]::
19196::$$$message_0146_0112_0003$$$::How blind of me. It was never something that could be quick and easy.::
19197::$$$message_0146_0113_0000$$$::Without either of us meaning to, our bodies touch.[lr]::
19198::$$$message_0146_0113_0001$$$::Sensing Sakura's slim body and the scent of her hair close to me, our fingers naturally intertwine.::
19199::$$$message_0146_0114_0000$$$::"...Senpai.[lr]::
19200::$$$message_0146_0114_0001$$$::I'm still the Sakura that you've always known, even now."[lr]::
19201::$$$message_0146_0114_0002$$$::"Yeah. You're you.[lr]::
19202::$$$message_0146_0114_0003$$$::...Sorry. I was so blinded by your dress that I got dumb ideas."::
19203::$$$message_0146_0115_0000$$$::"Ah[line len=2]yes...!"[lr]::
19204::$$$message_0146_0115_0001$$$::There's a strong sense of acceptance in her voice.[lr]::
19205::$$$message_0146_0115_0002$$$::Not the Sakura that's like a princess.[lr]::
19206::$$$message_0146_0115_0003$$$::The one that's in front of me is the usual Sakura simply dressed up as a princess.[lr]::
19207::$$$message_0146_0115_0004$$$::Sakura had not mistaken that from the start.::
19208::$$$message_0146_0116_0000$$$::"...Senpai, is it okay?"[lr]::
19209::$$$message_0146_0116_0001$$$::"What is?"[lr]::
19210::$$$message_0146_0116_0002$$$::"For me to be by your side forever. Will you allow that?"::
19211::$$$message_0146_0117_0000$$$::"The Sakura Matou by your side isn't a pretty princess.[lr]::
19212::$$$message_0146_0117_0001$$$::She's a plain, shy, and clumsy girl who can't even say what she wants to say.[lr]::
19213::$$$message_0146_0117_0002$$$::Are you still fine with that, Senpai...?"::
19214::$$$message_0146_0118_0000$$$::Of course.[lr]::
19215::$$$message_0146_0118_0001$$$::As long as we act on our thoughts and keep wishing, our everyday life will never end.::
19216::$$$message_0146_0119_0000$$$::"Even if I'm a girl that will get jealous about how beautiful Saber is or get a bit sad when you're getting along with my sister or Rider?"[lr]::
19217::$$$message_0146_0119_0001$$$::"Yeah. What's wrong with that?[lr]::
19218::$$$message_0146_0119_0002$$$::We're human, so there's a lot to think about.[lr]::
19219::$$$message_0146_0119_0003$$$::I like you the way that you are, and that's how I want you to be."::
19220::$$$message_0146_0120_0000$$$::"...Senpai."[lr]::
19221::$$$message_0146_0120_0001$$$::An entrancing whisper and teary eyes.[lr]::
19222::$$$message_0146_0120_0002$$$::"Oh, um..."[lr]::
19223::$$$message_0146_0120_0003$$$::My chest hurts.[lr]::
19224::$$$message_0146_0120_0004$$$::If she looks at me with those eyes, my face will burn up.::
19225::$$$message_0146_0121_0000$$$::"W-well, that's how it is, so I'll be counting on you from now... Damn, that doesn't sound like me, does it.[lr]::
19226::$$$message_0146_0121_0001$$$::It might be because of the atmosphere, but I'm saying something rather embarrassing. I'm acting weird, aren't I?"::
19227::$$$message_0146_0122_0000$$$::"No, not at all![lr]::
19228::$$$message_0146_0122_0001$$$::I think it's very much like you and great!"[lr]::
19229::$$$message_0146_0122_0002$$$::She replies, full of energy.[lr]::
19230::$$$message_0146_0122_0003$$$::...Well, that's a relief.::
19231::$$$message_0146_0123_0000$$$::"Also, there was one other good thing, but I'll keep it to myself.[lr]::
19232::$$$message_0146_0123_0001$$$::What you just clearly put in words will be my secret, just for me."::
19233::$$$message_0146_0124_0000$$$::Sakura smiles shyly.[lr]::
19234::$$$message_0146_0124_0001$$$::Whatever this secret is, it must be precious only to her, and no one else.::
19235::$$$message_0146_0125_0000$$$::"All right. Well, I'm going to keep relying on you."[lr]::
19236::$$$message_0146_0125_0001$$$::"No no, I owe you a lot, too.[lr]::
19237::$$$message_0146_0125_0002$$$::Thank you so much for today."[lr]::
19238::$$$message_0146_0125_0003$$$::Sakura bows bashfully.[lr]::
19239::$$$message_0146_0125_0004$$$::We act the same as we always do, but that's the biggest relief I could ask for.::
19240::$$$message_0146_0126_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. We need to properly thank Illya later."[lr]::
19241::$$$message_0146_0126_0001$$$::"Let's make Illya dinner at her house. We're going to make Illya wear a furisode this time. I'm sure she'll look cute."[lr]::
19242::$$$message_0146_0126_0002$$$::"I think Fuji-nee has a child-size furisode at her house... Good idea. Let's surprise Illya next time."::
19243::$$$message_0146_0127_0000$$$::We leave the garden as we talk,[lr]::
19244::$$$message_0146_0127_0001$$$::fingers still intertwined.[lr]::
19245::$$$message_0146_0127_0002$$$::We're still gently holding hands when we reach the lobby entrance.::
19246::$$$message_0146_0128_0000$$$::"Now then, we're going to stay here tonight, right? I'll see you to your room."[lr]::
19247::$$$message_0146_0128_0001$$$::"Oh... I'm okay. We met here with Illya's magic after all, so we'll part here, and I will return to the regular Sakura Matou tomorrow."::
19248::$$$message_0146_0129_0000$$$::"...I see. Yeah, that is for the best.[lr]::
19249::$$$message_0146_0129_0001$$$::I'll also return to my usual self tomorrow.[lr]::
19250::$$$message_0146_0129_0002$$$::Good night, Sakura."[lr]::
19251::$$$message_0146_0129_0003$$$::"Good night, Senpai."::
19252::$$$message_0146_0130_0000$$$::We part with a light bow to each other.[lr]::
19253::$$$message_0146_0130_0001$$$::The night as dazzling as her dress comes to an end.[lr]::
19254::$$$message_0146_0130_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
19255::$$$message_0146_0130_0003$$$::I try to extinguish the burning flame of love in my heart, as I head to my bedroom to welcome the morning.[lr]::
19256::$$$message_0146_0130_0004$$$::I blink several times, as if to engrave this beautiful Sakura into my memory. I hope I never forget it.::
o